  "title": "Romanian Revolution (1989)",
  "summary": "In December 1989 protests that began in Timișoara, after an attempt to evict pastor László Tőkés, spread across Romania. The army sided with demonstrators, Nicolae and Elena Ceaușescu fled Bucharest by helicopter on 22 December and were tried and executed on 25 December. Over a thousand people died.",
